  "body": "### What is the issue with the WebHID Standard?\n\nStep 3 of sections 7.4, 7.5, and 7.6 refer to\n\n> \"[TypeError](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#exceptiondef-typeerror)\" [DOMException](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException)\n\nHowever, `TypeError` is just [a simple JS exception](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#exceptiondef-typeerror) and not a `DOMException`.",
